{{ToonInfo|Toon=Cosmo|extra=Pastry|Date=August 14th, 2024|with={{CI|Finn|name=true}}, {{CI|Glisten|name=true}}, and {{CI|Sprout|name=true}}|Pronoun=He}}

==Appearance==
Cosmo is a brown pastry resembling a chocolate Swiss Roll. He has white icing drizzled in a squiggly pattern on the top of his head, which is paired with 6 cyan, pink, and lime star-shaped sprinkles on his cheeks, resembling freckles. He wears a white, sleeveless hoodie with black drawstrings and a white hemming on the bottom. He has striped socks the same color as his sprinkle freckles, the socks completely cover his legs. Cosmo has confirmed that his star sprinkles on his cheeks do not come off, being part of his design, said in a conversation with {{CI|Glisten|name=true}}.

==Personality==
Cosmo is a helpful, yet cautious [[Toon]]. True to {{CI|Dandy|name=true}}'s dialogue when buying Cosmo's Toon License, Cosmo stands out with his sweet and caring personality. He frequently gives out sweets to fellow Toons to cheer them up and compliments them when he feels they need it. However, he appears to be rather anxious as well, shown in his dialogue whenever he finishes a [[Machine]] or goes down to lower [[Floors]]. Cosmo's hobby of baking can be assumed to stem from both a source of comfort and a desire to help others.

He is clueless on some jokes and can be rather gullible to teasing, such as in his interactions with {{CI|Finn|name=true}} and {{CI|Gigi|name=true}}, but he always makes sure to care for his friends and encourage them when they most need it. It should be noted that though Cosmo can be rather soft-spoken and anxious, he is by no means a pushover, as demonstrated in his firm refusal to {{CI|Rodger|name=true}}'s prods at asking questions regarding his best friend, {{CI|Sprout|name=true}}, and telling {{CI|Eggson|name=true}} he can't hide the eggs for him to find. Cosmo's sensitive side is mentioned in {{CI|Flutter|name=true}} and Sprout's interaction dialogue, as Sprout mentions Cosmo cried for a whole week when the gumball eyes melted on the cookies they made of Flutter's face. This is also why, in {{CI|Poppy|name=true}}'s dialogue, he says, "{{Text|Never again.}}"

